{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17782","headline":"春日奉献圣寿无疆词十首 九 · 杨巨源","name":"春日奉献圣寿无疆词十首 九","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"日上苍龙阙，香含紫禁林。\n晴光五云叠，春色九重深。\n赏叶元和德，文垂雅颂音。\n景云随御辇，颢气在宸襟。\n永保无疆寿，长怀不战心。\n圣朝多庆赐，琼树粉墙阴。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杨巨源","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17782.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17782","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}